      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by deleting the word “licence”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/19/eng@/~cl_14__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/19/eng@/~cl_14",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the word “levies” the words “, financial penalties,”. Amendment of section 45"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/19/eng@/~cl_15",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "15",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/19/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 45 of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “five million” the words “fifty million”. New section 53a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/19/eng@/~cl_16",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "16",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/19/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 53 the following section: “Power of Commission to publish information 53a. The Commission may, where it thinks necessary or expedient in the interest of the public in such form or manner as it thinks fit, publish any information in relation to— (a) the grant of, lapsing, revocation or suspension of an approval, licence or exemption granted under any communications and multimedia law to any person; (b) the issuance of any directions, guidelines, determinations, decisions or any other legal instruments under any communications and multimedia law; (c) any civil action taken under any communications and multimedia law; (d) the compounding of any offence under any communications and multimedia law; or (e) any civil or criminal proceedings brought— (i) under any communications or multimedia law against any person and the outcome of such proceedings, including any settlement, whether in or out of court; or (ii) under any other law, whether the law of Malaysia or the law of any territory or country outside Malaysia, against any person and the outcome of such proceedings, including any settlement, whether in or out of court.”. (Amendment) Saving and transitional provisions"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/19/eng@/~cl_17",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "17",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/19/eng@/~cl_17__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/19/eng@/~cl_17__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/19/eng@/~cl_17__subsec_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/19/eng@"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/19/eng@/~cl_17__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/19/eng@/~cl_17",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any direction by the Minister given to the Commission under section 18 before the coming into operation of this Act shall, on the date of coming into operation of this Act, continue to be in force until modified, varied or revoked."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/19/eng@/~cl_17__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/19/eng@/~cl_17",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Chairman holding the office of the chief executive immediately before the coming into operation of this Act shall continue to hold such office and shall be deemed to be appointed as the chief executive officer under the principal Act as amended by this Act."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/19/eng@/~cl_17__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/19/eng@/~cl_17",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Notwithstanding the provisions of this Act, the members of the Commission holding office before the coming into operation of section 3 of this Act shall continue to hold such office until the expiry of their respective terms."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/19/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/19/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act may be cited as the Malaysian Communications and Multimedia Commission (Amendment) Act 2026."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/19/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/19/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act comes into operation on a date to be appointed by the Minister by notification in the Gazette and the Minister may appoint different dates for the coming into operation of different provisions of this Act. Amendment of section 3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/19/eng@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/19/eng@/~cl_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/19/eng@/~cl_2__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/19/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Malaysian Communications and Multimedia Commission Act 1998 [Act 589], which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Act, is amended in section 3—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/19/eng@/~cl_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/19/eng@/~cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the definition of “Chairman”, by substituting for the words “paragraph 6(a)” the words “paragraph 6(1)(a)”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/19/eng@/~cl_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/19/eng@/~cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the definition of “communications and multimedia laws” the following definition: ‘ “communications system” has the meaning assigned to it in the Communications and Multimedia Act 1998 [Act 588];’. Substitution of section 6"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/19/eng@/~cl_3",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/19/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by substituting for section 6 the following section: “Membership of Commission 6. (1) The Commission shall consist of the following members who shall be appointed by the Minister: (a) a Chairman, who shall not be a member of a House of Parliament or any Legislative Assembly; (b) three members representing the Federal Government, whereby one of the members shall be the Secretary General of the Ministry charged with the responsibility for communications and multimedia who shall be an ex-officio member; and (c) not less than two but not more than seven other members who have experience and knowledge in matters relating to communications and multimedia, finance, engineering, commerce, law, economics, public administration, competition, consumer protection, social science or any other suitable qualification as the Minister may determine. (2) The members of the Commission shall not be an employee of the Commission, except for the Chairman who is also the chief executive officer under section 20.”. (Amendment) Substitution of section 10"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/19/eng@/~cl_4",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/19/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by substituting for section 10 the following section: “Tenure of office 10. (1) The tenure of office— (a) of the Chairman appointed under paragraph 6(1)(a) shall be for a term of two years and such Chairman shall be eligible for reappointment for the same term, but shall not hold office for more than five terms either continuously or otherwise; and (b) of a member appointed under paragraph 6(1)(b) or (c), other than an ex-officio member, shall be for a term of two years and such member shall be eligible for reappointment for the same term, but shall not hold office for more than five terms either continuously or otherwise. (2) Notwithstanding subsection (1), a person appointed as the Chairman under paragraph 6(1)(a) or as any member under paragraph 6(1)(b) or (c), except for an ex-officio member, who has completed the tenure of his office of five terms specified in paragraph (1)(a) or (b) either continuously or otherwise sometimes one and sometimes another, shall be eligible for appointment to the other office under paragraph 6(1)(a), (b) or (c) and shall hold the office for the same term specified in paragraph (1)(a) or (b), as the case maybe.”. Amendment of section 13"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/19/eng@/~cl_5",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/19/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 13 of the principal Act is amended by substituting for paragraph (f) the following paragraph: “(f) in the case of the Chairman— (i) if he absents himself from a meeting of the Commission without leave of the Minister; or (ii) if he is elected or appointed as a member of a House of Parliament or any Legislative Assembly;”. New section 14a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/19/eng@/~cl_6",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/19/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 14 the following section: “Cessation of appointment of Chairman 14a. In the event that the Chairman is, for any reason, absent from duty or from Malaysia or unable to perform the duties of his office for six consecutive months without leave of the Minister, the Minister shall appoint another person to be the Chairman in accordance with this Act and upon such appointment, the previous Chairman shall cease to be a member of the Commission.”. Amendment of section 16"
      }
