      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after paragraph (i) the following paragraphs: “(ia) to develop and regulate standards on infrastructure and platforms that will promote interoperability, trust and spur growth of the communications and multimedia industry and the broader Malaysian economy; (ib) to develop and regulate standards concerning safety, security protection, integrity and reliability of information assets, communications networks and services provided over the communications networks; (Amendment) (ic) to review or audit any of the information which a licensee or any other person providing services related to communications system is required to furnish to the Commission; (id) to audit or cause to be audited activities of any licensee or any other person providing services related to communications system determined by the Commission; and”. Amendment of section 17"
